---
// Standalone recruiting flyer for /apply/animator
// Self-contained poster: intentionally does NOT use Base.astro (no site nav/footer chrome).
// Temporary page; discoverable is fine (no noindex).
const title = 'Rive Keyframe Animator (Paid Gig) | Devtegra';
const description =
  "We're looking for keyframe animators to bring cutout characters to life in Rive. Paid per animation cycle. Remote, students welcome.";
const canonical = new URL('/apply/animator', Astro.site);
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>{title}</title>
<meta name="description" content={description} />
<link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
<meta property="og:site_name" content="Devtegra" />
<meta property="og:title" content={title} />
<meta property="og:description" content={description} />
<meta property="og:url" content={canonical} />
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
<meta name="twitter:title" content={title} />
<meta name="twitter:description" content={description} />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Baloo+2:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style is:global>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html, body {
    background: #0f0f14;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }
  .page {
    width: 850px;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #1B1C26;
    color: #F2F0E8;
    position: relative;
    padding: 64px 60px 48px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    color: #7FE7C4;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before {
    content: "";
    width: 8px; height: 8px;
    background: #7FE7C4;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: 'Baloo 2', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 68px;
    line-height: 1.03;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    margin: 22px 0 18px;
    color: #F6F4EC;
  }
  h1 span { color: #FF8A5C; }
  .subhead {
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #B9B7AE;
    max-width: 560px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .moodrow {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    margin: 40px 0 8px;
  }
  .mood {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .mood svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
  .mood-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .moodrow-caption {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: #75736A;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 34px;
  }

  .grid {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    margin: 52px 0 26px;
  }
  .card {
    background: #23242F;
    border: 1px solid #33343F;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 30px 30px;
    flex: 1.15;
  }
  .card.tool-card { flex: 0.85; }
  .card h2 {
    font-family: 'Baloo 2', sans-serif;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #F6F4EC;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .card ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 13px;
  }
  .card li {
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #CFCDC3;
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .card li::before {
    content: "\25B8";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #FF8A5C;
  }
  .tool-card {
    background: #1F2A28;
    border: 1px solid #2C4A42;
  }
  .tool-card h2 { color: #7FE7C4; }
  .tool-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #C6E4DA;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .tool-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #0f0f14;
    background: #7FE7C4;
    padding: 9px 14px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    word-break: break-all;
  }
  .free-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: #7FE7C4;
    border: 1px solid #3E6157;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .pay-strip {
    margin-top: 26px;
    background: #2B2418;
    border: 1px solid #4A3B22;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 26px 30px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .pay-strip .label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: #E8B368;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .pay-strip .big {
    font-family: 'Baloo 2', sans-serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #F6F4EC;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .pay-strip .small {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: #C9BBA0;
    max-width: 300px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .tabs-wrap {
    margin-top: 34px;
    display: flex;
    border-top: 2px dashed #3A3B47;
  }
  .tab {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 18px 10px 4px;
    border-right: 2px dashed #3A3B47;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  }
  .tab.tab-apply { flex: 1.35; }
  .tab:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .tab .t1 { font-size: 10.5px; color: #75736A; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .tab .t2 { font-size: 12px; color: #F2F0E8; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px; word-break: break-word; }

  .footer-note {
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #75736A;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .footer-note b { color: #B9B7AE; font-weight: 600; }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .page { padding: 44px 24px 36px; }
    h1 { font-size: 46px; }
    .subhead { font-size: 17px; }
    .grid { flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; margin: 38px 0 22px; }
    .pay-strip { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; }
    .pay-strip .big { white-space: normal; }
    .pay-strip .small { max-width: none; }
    .tabs-wrap { flex-wrap: wrap; border-top: none; }
    .tab {
      flex: 1 1 44%;
      border-right: none;
      border-top: 2px dashed #3A3B47;
      text-align: left;
      padding: 14px 6px 6px;
    }
    .tab.tab-apply { flex: 1 1 100%; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <div class="eyebrow">Paid gig · Remote · Students welcome</div>
  <h1>Rig it.<br />Animate it.<br />Get paid <span>per cycle.</span></h1>
  <p class="subhead">We're looking for keyframe animators to bring cutout characters to life, one mood at a time.</p>

  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>What you'll do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Set up cutout rigs for existing character art: bones and pivots</li>
        <li>Animate mood and expression cycles on a timeline</li>
        <li>Bring each mood to life through movement and expression</li>
        <li>Work one character, one mood, one cycle at a time</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card tool-card">
      <div class="free-badge">Free · runs in browser</div>
      <h2>Built in Rive</h2>
      <p>No install, no license. If you've never opened Rive, the getting-started docs will have you rigging by the end of an afternoon.</p>
      <a class="tool-link" href="https://rive.app/docs/getting-started/introduction">rive.app/docs/getting-started →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pay-strip">
    <div>
      <div class="label">How you get paid</div>
      <div class="big">Paid per animation cycle</div>
    </div>
    <div class="small">Rig setup for each character is billed separately, once. After that, every mood cycle you ship is its own paid deliverable.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-note"><b>Who we're looking for:</b> animation students comfortable with cutout setup and keyframe animation. A short reel, a rough test clip, or even a Rive file you've been messing around in is enough to start a conversation.</div>

  <div class="tabs-wrap">
    <div class="tab tab-apply"><div class="t1">Apply</div><div class="t2">contact.us@devtegra.com</div></div>
    <div class="tab"><div class="t1">Subject line</div><div class="t2">Rive Animator</div></div>
    <div class="tab"><div class="t1">Software</div><div class="t2">Rive (free)</div></div>
    <div class="tab"><div class="t1">Pay</div><div class="t2">Per cycle</div></div>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
